{"evidence":["`crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs:9-53` computes O2 `K_LA` from the shared hardware terms and normalizes it by the tank's actual surface-area-to-volume ratio against a reference geometry, so equal-footprint tanks exchange similar total gas mass while shallower tanks change concentration faster.","`crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:47-58` derives raw CO2 `K_LA` from `compute_o2_kla(state) * 0.91`, and `crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:578-589` applies the Euler cap at the usage site, which keeps CO2 and O2 on the same transfer-coefficient basis even when raw O2 `K_LA` exceeds 1.0.","`crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:578-612` computes atmospheric CO2 exchange from carbonate-solved aqueous CO2 versus Henry-law equilibrium and immediately re-resolves carbonate state after DIC changes, so aeration-driven CO2 stripping propagates into bicarbonate and pH in the same hourly chemistry step.","`crates/tank_core/tests/co2_exchange.rs:216-316` verifies the corrected same-footprint invariant (similar total DIC mass flux, faster concentration change in the shallower tank), and `crates/tank_core/tests/co2_exchange.rs:502-532` exercises the real `compute_co2_kla()` path both below and above the O2 cap.","`crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs:424-477` and `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs:592-600` clear stale `spawn_progress_accum` and `hatch_success_carry` when no eligible adults/cohorts remain, and `cargo test -q -p tank_core --test shrimp_population --test shrimp_feeding_pathway` passed (27/27), so the collateral accumulator fixes did not introduce a regression.","`cargo test -q -p tank_core --test co2_exchange --test chemistry --test dissolved_oxygen --test concentration_helpers --test save_load --test validation --test shrimp_population --test shrimp_feeding_pathway` passed (115/115), `cargo test -q` passed across the full workspace, and `cargo clippy -q -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` plus `cargo fmt --check -p tank_core` both passed in the current checkout."],"findings_or_gaps":["No correctness, regression, or completeness issues were found in the current checkout for this task."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"}